# Local assistant persona — per-clone, not versioned. Mirrors .gitignore's
# Config/* exclusion so a local docker build never bakes a personal
# system-prompt file into the image.
Config/*
!Config/system-prompt.example.md

# Personal automation scripts — mirrors .gitignore's Scripts/* exclusion so a
# local docker build never bakes personal scheduled-job scripts into the image.
Scripts/*
!Scripts/testJobScheduler.py